IMPORTANT

This dashboard is NOT a management page.

This is the central operating system of an AI Intent Factory.

The user should feel like they are operating GitHub Copilot Enterprise or Microsoft Azure AI Studio.

Every section must encourage operators toward the next workflow automatically.



AI WORKFLOW ORCHESTRATOR

The dashboard should behave like an intelligent project manager.

After every completed task,
AI automatically recommends the next best action.

Examples:

Knowledge uploaded
→ Generate Intent

Intent approved
→ Generate Entity

Entity approved
→ Generate Synonyms

FAQ linked
→ Validate Pack

Pack validated
→ Run Runtime Simulation

Simulation passed
→ Build Pack

Build completed
→ Deploy Pack

Never leave the user without a recommended next action.

Always display a single prominent "Next Recommended Action" button at the top of the dashboard.